    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["MU1"],
    "module_designation": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "description": "The MU1 instrument is a class III or IIII, non-automatic weighing instrument with single-interval or dual-range, comprising an MU1 analog data processing unit, a load receptor, and a PC with display. The MU1 analog data processing unit is a single chip microprocessor based unit running on USB bus power; the PC user interface software presents the user interface, controls, and primary indications. Software is split into a metrological and an operational part; identification of the MU1 firmware can be observed on command from the PC user interface."
